<section class="hero">
  <span class="kicker">AI R&amp;D · November 2026</span>
  <h1>AI: is the acceleration accelerating?</h1>
  <p class="lede"><b>It all depends on r.</b> In one year, Anthropic nearly doubled the speed at which its models improve, largely thanks to AI itself. A plateau, or the start of a runaway? It all hinges on one number, r, that nobody can measure yet.</p>
